      "message": "In my impression the quirk matches yours first glance. Corsola should still has the WBS from [1]\nBut let\u0027s wait for chharry@. \n\nThis issue is found on Kukui and also older boards like Eve.\nIf you want to enable WBS without EDR please check those boards as well.\n\n[1] https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/kernel/v5.10/drivers/bluetooth/btmtksdio.c;l\u003d1128;drc\u003db1f78868fcbfcdf106e518943b55b1bb0e7c35f0",
